{"id":"b4756908c8b755cf","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-p-subgroup.md","title":"p-Subgroup","display":"df-p-subgroup — p-Subgroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-p-subgroup","aliases":["58-df-p-subgroup","P-Subgroup"],"display":"df-p-subgroup — p-Subgroup","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-sylow.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-p-subgroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-p-subgroup</span><span>P-Subgroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-subgroup — p-Subgroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac978c566ec8e658\" href=\"?note=ac978c566ec8e658\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-p-group.md\">../batch08/58-df-p-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b2cc87480438176a\" href=\"?note=b2cc87480438176a\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-sylow.md\">../batch09/58-df-sylow.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H,P,p\\in V\">\\(G,H,P,p\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_G\\in V\">\\(\\cdot_G\\in V\\)</span> 为下式中量化的环境群运算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S\\)</span> 为三参数谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pSubgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{pSubgroup}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S\\)</span> 的三参数形式由下式定义；四参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S\\)</span> 取依赖文件中的结构定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pSubgroup}_S(H,G,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S(H,\\cdot_G\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),p)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{pSubgroup}_S(H,G,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S(H,\\cdot_G\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),p)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S(P,G,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_G\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S(P,G,\\cdot_G,p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S(P,G,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_G\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S(P,G,\\cdot_G,p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This definition also covers infinite p-subgroups; for finite groups it is equivalent to the usual maximal power-of-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> order characterization.</li>\n<li>Existence, conjugacy, and the congruence for the number of Sylow subgroups are Sylow theorems, not defining clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-p-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ac978c566ec8e658","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-sylow.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2cc87480438176a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-sylow.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,H,P,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pSubgroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pSubgroup}_S(H,G,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(H,G,\\cdot_G)\n\\land\\mathrm{PGroupStructure}_S(H,\\cdot_G\\upharpoonright(H\\times H),p)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S(P,G,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\cdot_G\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SylowSubgroup}_S(P,G,\\cdot_G,p).","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-934","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-p-subgroup.md|58-df-p-subgroup]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["59685d062adf2748","ac978c566ec8e658","b2cc87480438176a"]}